{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bark and Catch</strong> \u2013 A fast-paced game for 1-4 players where you take on the role of dogs and must complete important farm tasks within a time limit: grow and prepare food, feed the animals, and deliver farm products to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/MainGif.gif?t=1745255872\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Teamwork</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your friends via local multiplayer on one PC or Steam Remote Play Together. You can divide tasks to maximize efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/TeamGif.gif?t=1745255872\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Keep the Farm Safe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wolves, foxes, wild boars, and other predators will try to cause chaos on the farm\u2014scaring livestock, stealing, and eating crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your additional task is to fend them off by any means necessary: barking, defensive towers, and other structures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/extras/GuardGif2.gif?t=1745255872\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353090?t=1745255872","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353090?t=1745255872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/bda34982b94a1d7614dadae17588b0565b80e774/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745255872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353090/bda34982b94a1d7614dadae17588b0565b80e774/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745255872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"d